Package: pipelineR
Title: Financial Data ETL from Yahoo Finance to PostgreSQL
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Pierrick", "KINIF", email = "pierrick.kinif@datagrowth.io", role = 'cre')
Description: Automates an end-to-end pipeline: read ticker symbols from PostgreSQL,
    download OHLCV history via 'tidyquant' (Yahoo Finance), pivot to long format,
    append only non-duplicate rows to a student schema, and log batch outcomes.
    Designed for teaching and internal workflows that use 'RPostgres' and a shared
    'sp500.info' reference table.
